This is a branch for implementing an XML writer.

XML writer is a set of functions for creating xml tags and writing them
directly to a general svn stream without temporary buffers.

This is my old work, but it's not ready for 1.15 trunk, so I decided to
commit it to a branch instead. I'll be very happy to receive any feedback.

Most probably, I'll keep this work in the branch until 1.15 is released, and
then include it in the 1.16 with the xpatch feature.

There is no need to release it in 1.15 without any real usages.

It was mostly made to implement xpatch feature, since it would require a lot
of xml writes, but can be also used for anything in subversion, including
cmdline with `--xml` option, and maybe even ra-serf library.

This api will not only simplify xml writing, but also will allow several
improvements to happen. For example, it might be possible to indent xml
tags, so we will get pretty looking output out-of-box.
